          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At WORLDPROM, sustainability is at the heart of everything we do. From selecting eco-friendly fabrics to implementing responsible production practices, we are committed to making a positive impact on both your style and the planet. Our mission is to create stunning, high-quality pieces that not only make you look and feel amazing but also contribute to a brighter, more sustainable future for all.</p>",
