    "collapsible_content_ckRAWw": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_tab_GeCFJq": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Quality You Can Feel",
            "open": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>At WORLDPROM, we believe that true luxury begins with the fabric. Our evening and prom dresses are crafted from premium materials that not only look stunning but also feel extraordinary. Experience the difference of fabrics that exude elegance and comfort, elevating your entire look and ensuring you feel confident all night long.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "custom_liquid": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_w3jgDt": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Stretch & Shape-Retaining",
            "open": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Our exclusive stretch and shape-retaining fabrics are designed to move with you, providing the perfect balance of flexibility and structure. Whether you're dancing the night away at prom or enjoying an elegant evening event, these fabrics adapt to your natural movements while keeping your silhouette flawless. The high-quality fibers used in our designs retain their shape beautifully, offering a smooth, polished look wear after wear.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "custom_liquid": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_cL4XHt": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Luxuriously Soft Textures",
            "open": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Indulge in the luxurious softness of our fabrics, specially chosen to enhance both comfort and sophistication. Whether you're looking for the ideal prom dress or an evening gown that makes a statement, our soft textures offer a premium feel that enhances the overall experience. These fabrics not only look beautiful but also feel like a dream against your skin, ensuring you're comfortable and elegant all evening long.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "custom_liquid": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_4dQrB4": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Hypoallergenic & Gentle",
            "open": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>For those with sensitive skin, WorldProm offers fabrics that are both luxurious and gentle. Our hypoallergenic materials ensure that you can enjoy the elegance of a high-end evening or prom dress without worry. These fabrics are designed to provide ultimate softness and comfort, minimizing irritation and offering a gentle touch for even the most sensitive skin types.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "custom_liquid": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_4ypRVW": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Fade-Resistant Colors",
            "open": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>When choosing a dress for your special occasion, we understand that the vibrancy of the color is essential. That's why our fabrics feature fade-resistant colors, ensuring that your evening or prom dress remains as vibrant and brilliant as the moment you first wore it. Our advanced fabric techniques and high-quality dyes help maintain the brilliance and freshness of your dress, no matter how many times it’s worn or washed.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "custom_liquid": ""
          }
        }
      },
